    "description": {
      "content": "The Apache Iceberg REST Catalog API is an open standard (OpenAPI spec) for interacting with Apache Iceberg table catalogs. It provides a common HTTP interface for catalog operations including namespace management, table lifecycle, view management, and metadata operations. Multiple catalog implementations support this specification including Apache Polaris, Project Nessie, AWS Glue, and Google BigLake.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Apache Iceberg Community",
